  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HQAI Facilitation Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Facilitation Fund will enable the development of its three core activities:
&#x2022; Grant subsidies to L/NNGOs: Subsidies are granted for a three-year period (50 to 90% of the audit
costs are subsided depending on several factors).
&#x2022; Audit groups of L/NNGOS: Group audit approaches allow for several independent organisations to
join forces in a) implementing the CHS, b) learning and improving together and c) being
independently assessed (economies of scale).
&#x2022; Develop a network of local auditors and audit facilitators: The creation of a pool of local experts will
contribute to the creation of auditing capacities closer to the sites of operations of HQAI partners.</narrative>
  </description>
